# StudyForge environment — copy this file to ".env" and fill in your value.
# The backend loads .env automatically (backend/.env or project-root/.env).
#
# Real "Continue with Google" needs a Google Cloud OAuth 2.0 Web client ID.
# Full walkthrough: SETUP_GOOGLE_LOGIN.md
#
# Leave this empty and email + password sign-in still works completely;
# the Google button will just say it isn't configured yet.
GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=
